    "proposal_rationale": "Third and final untried candidate: retain candidate 2 actions and placement/mapping parameters, raising only repair_margin from 0 to 10 to target its electrical failure. All seven complete captured input records, including inline protocol and measured histories, were inspected. Candidate 2 at margin 0 reported cell/die area 161973/378736 um2, setup/hold slack +0.105414/+0.122652 ns, max_slew/max_cap/max_fanout violations 16/6/0, failure_classes=[electrical], physical_qualified=false and rank_eligible=false. Its physical cost was 4165.577836435987 s. Candidate 1 with both actions reported area 160081/374764 um2, setup/hold slack -0.0262439/+0.0945523 ns, zero electrical violations, failure_classes=[physical_execution,timing], and physical cost 3516.572450898995 s. Both failed candidates have empty energy/power dictionaries and no postprocessing commands; neither establishes qualified Q. Keep operand_isolation=false to avoid reintroducing masking delay; retain the protocol-proved exact signed 18-bit reduction with 32-bit sign extension and unchanged cycle contract. More repair margin may improve slew/capacitance closure but add buffers, cell area, switching capacitance or timing pressure. Closure and energy savings remain hypotheses; no critical paths or violating nets are captured. Candidate 2 area already slightly exceeds baseline, so electrical closure alone cannot establish an improvement. Baseline remains the only qualified incumbent: cell area 161954 um2, setup/hold +0.19292/+0.114491 ns, Q=1. Optimize Q=(cell_area_um2/161954)*geomean(E_DOT64/2.293945631906608e-7,E_GEMM8/1.7792685987008622e-6,E_CONV3/1.1542462882162743e-6); die area earns no score. Protected evaluation must report configuration, rtl_actions, cell/die area, setup/hold slack, electrical_violations, failure_classes, physical_qualified, measurement_qualified, rank_eligible, all workload energies/powers, activity/parasitic annotation, area_ratio, energy_ratio, score, manifests and execution costs. Retain all failures and costs and the best qualified result. This uses the remaining third evaluation slot under the common 1200-second aggregate agent budget; EDA wait is separate and captured elapsed search time does not establish remaining agent time. Frozen period is 10526 ps. Energy scope remains Liberty-model estimates from zero-delay post-route activity and extracted SPEF, without SDF/glitch or silicon-power claims. No new EDA result or threshold achievement is asserted.",
